            "content": "# Development Loan\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe Development Loan supports members undertaking income-generating or\npersonal development activities, such as small business expansion, land\nimprovement, or asset purchase.\n\n## Terms\n\n| Feature             | Detail                                                                      |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Maximum amount      | UGX 10,000,000, subject to the 3x-savings ceiling in `loan_requirements.md` |\n| Interest rate       | 12% per annum, reducing balance                                             |\n| Repayment period    | Up to 24 months                                                             |\n| Guarantors required | 2 (see `guarantor_requirements.md`)                                         |\n| Grace period        | First repayment due 30 days after disbursement                              |\n\n## Additional requirements\n\n- A short written statement describing the business or development purpose\n  the loan will fund must accompany the application (see\n  `supporting_documents.md`).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Interest is calculated monthly on the outstanding principal (reducing\n  balance), so early repayment reduces total interest paid.\n"
          }
